				</div>
				<p class="box-tit">2027<br> 수시모집 안내</p>
				<div class="box-in">
					<div class="box-top">
						<ul class="date-list">
							<center><li><span class="tit"><font size="5"><b>2027 수시모집</span>에 지원해 주셔서 감사합니다.</b></font></li></center><br>
							<li><span class="tit">첨부서류 제출: </span> 2026.9.17(목) 17:00까지 제출마감</li>
						</ul>
						<ul class="link-list">
							<li class="cor1"><a href="http://addon.jinhakapply.com/RatioV1/RatioH/Ratio30100311.html" target="_blank" title="새창 열림"><span class="btnTxt">최종 지원현황</span></a></li>
							<li class="cor2"><a href="https://entr.ysu.ac.kr/ysu_enter/?mode=A" target="_blank" title="새창 열림">첨부서류 도착확인</span></a></li>
							<li class="cor3"><a href="https://entr.ysu.ac.kr/ysu_enter/?mode=A" target="_blank" title="새창 열림"><span class="btnTxt">접수확인(수험생용)</span></a></li>
							<li class="cor4"><a href="https://entr.ysu.ac.kr/ysu_enter/?mode=G" target="_blank" title="새창 열림"><span class="btnTxt">접수확인(교사용)</span></a></li>
							<li class="cor5"><a href="https://ipsi.ysu.ac.kr/ipsi/CMS/Board/Board.do?mCode=MN027" target="_blank" title="새창 열림"><span class="btnTxt">입시상담Q/A</span></a></li>
							<li class="cor6"><a href="https://www.ysu.ac.kr/ipsi/CMS/Board/Board.do?mCode=MN021&mode=view&mgr_seq=395&board_seq=642774" target="_blank" title="새창 열림"><span class="btnTxt">면접출제문항</span></a></li>
						</ul>
						<ul class="date-list">
							<li>
								<span class="tit">향후 입시일정</span>
								<ul class="inner-list">
									<li><span class="subtit">면접·실기고사</span> 10.2(금) 항공관광, 레저스포츠관광, 경찰행정전공
									<br> 10.3(토) 해운대캠퍼스 소속학과
									<br> 10.24(토) 양산캠퍼스 소속학과 </li>
									<li><span class="subtit">합격자발표</span> 2026.11.11(수) 예정</li>
								</ul>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="janghak">
						<img src="/resources/_Img/Intro/2026_intro_img_04.png" alt="">
						<div class="txt-sec">
							<a href="https://www.ysu.ac.kr/ipsi/CMS/Contents/Contents.do?mCode=MN031" class="jangbtn" target="_blank">2027 신입생 장학제도 안내</a>
							<ul class="c-list01">
								<li>신입학 특별장학금<br>(정원내 최초합격자 첫학기 50% 감면)
									<span class="info">※ 간호학과, 물리치료학과 첫학기 30% 감면</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
